The six skills in this directory (grounded-citations, grill-me,
one-three-one, systematic-debugging, document-to-action-items and
meeting-action-items) are adapted from Hermes Agent by Nous Research,
https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent, at commit
6e69a8933adda7dbbff7cf3009a259a4524477e9, under the license above.

Two of them derive in part from further upstream work, also under the MIT
license, whose copyright notices are reproduced here:

- grill-me: the grilling skill in mattpocock/skills,
  https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
  Copyright (c) 2026 Matt Pocock

- systematic-debugging: obra/superpowers,
  https://github.com/obra/superpowers
  Copyright (c) 2025 Jesse Vincent

The other four credit no further upstream in their author lines.
